lass=\"mt-3.5 text-[14px] leading-[1.7] text-white/55\" data-kid=\"311\">Análise e seleção de imóveis em leilão com alto potencial.</p>\n            <span class=\"mt-8 block text-[#B49452] opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100\" style=\"transition: opacity .5s;\" data-kid=\"312\">\n              <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-kid=\"313\"></svg>\n            </span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div data-reveal-wrap data-kid=\"316\">\n          <div class=\"group h-full border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-9 hover:-translate-y-1.5 hover:border-[#B49452]/70 hover:bg-white/[0.06]\" style=\"transition: transform .5s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1), border-color .5s, background-color .5s;\" data-kid=\"317\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-start justify-between\" data-kid=\"318\">\n              <span class=\"text-[#D9C9A3]\" data-kid=\"319\">\n                <svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" data-kid=\"320\"></svg>\n              </span>\n              <span class=\"font-display text-[34px] font-light leading-none text-[#B49452]/55\" data-kid=\"324\">03</span>\n            </div>\n            <h3 class=\"font-display mt-12 text-[23px] font-light tracking-[-0.01em] text-white\" data-kid=\"325\">Imóveis para Renda</h3>\n            <p class=\"mt-3.5 text-[14px] leading-[1.7] text-white/55\" data-kid=\"326\">Ativos selecionados para rentabilidade mensal consistente.</p>\n            <span class=\"mt-8 block text-[#B49452] opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100\" style=\"transition: opacity .5s;\" data-kid=\"327\">\n              <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-kid=\"328\"></svg>\n            </span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div data-reveal-wrap data-kid=\"331\">\n          <div class=\"group h-full border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-9 hover:-translate-y-1.5 hover:border-[#B49452]/70 hover:bg-white/[0.06]\" style=\"transition: transform .5s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1), border-color .5s, background-color .5s;\" data-kid=\"332\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-start justify-between\" data-kid=\"333\">\n              <span class=\"text-[#D9C9A3]\" data-kid=\"334\">\n                <svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" data-kid=\"335\"></svg>\n              </span>\n              <span class=\"font-display text-[34px] font-light leading-none text-[#B49452]/55\" data-kid=\"340\">04</span>\n            </div>\n            <h3 class=\"font-display mt-12 text-[23px] font-light tracking-[-0.01em] text-white\" data-kid=\"341\">Imóveis para Revenda</h3>\n            <p class=\"mt-3.5 text-[14px] leading-[1.7] text-white/55\" data-kid=\"342\">Oportunidades de curto prazo com margem de valorização.</p>\n            <span class=\"mt-8 block text-[#B49452] opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100\" style=\"transition: opacity .5s;\" data-kid=\"343\">\n              <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-kid=\"344\"></svg>\n            </span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  \n  <section class=\"py-[150px]\" data-kid=\"347\">\n    <div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-[1280px] grid-cols-2 items-center gap-24 px-10\" data-kid=\"348\">\n      <div data-kid=\"349\">\n        <div data-reveal class=\"flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"350\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#6B6A66]\" data-kid=\"351\">\n            <span class=\"grow-line h-px w-10 bg-[#B49452]\" style=\"transform-origin:left;\" data-kid=\"352\"></span> Região de atuação\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"font-display text-[44px] font-light leading-none text-[#E8E5DF]\" data-kid=\"353\">05</span>\n        </div>\n        <h2 data-reveal class=\"font-display mt-7 text-[56px] font-light leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.025em]\" data-kid=\"354\">\n          Atuação em todo o <em class=\"italic text-[#8A7340]\" data-kid=\"355\">Estado de São Paulo</em>.\n        </h2>\n        <p data-reveal class=\"mt-6 text-[16px] leading-[1.75] text-[#6B6A66]\" data-kid=\"356\">\n          Conectando investidores às melhores oportunidades imobiliárias do estado, com presença estratégica em São José dos Campos e Vale do Paraíba.\n        </p>\n        <p data-reveal class=\"mt-5 text-[14px] leading-[1.85] text-[#6B6A66]\" data-kid=\"357\">\n          Atuamos na prospecção e análise de oportunidades imobiliárias em todo o Estado de São Paulo, com especialização em imóveis Caixa, imóveis abaixo do valor de mercado, leilões e investimentos patrimoniais. Nossa atuação possui forte presença em São José dos Campos e em toda a região do Vale do Paraíba — um dos polos econômicos mais relevantes do país.\n        </p>\n        <div data-reveal class=\"mt-9 flex flex-wrap gap-2.5\" data-kid=\"358\">\n          <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-[#E8E5DF] bg-white px-4 py-2.5 text-[12px] tracking-wide text-[#3A3A38]\" data-kid=\"359\"><svg width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#B49452\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" data-kid=\"360\"></svg> Estado de São Paulo</span>\n          <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-[#E8E5DF] bg-white px-4 py-2.5 text-[12px] tracking-wide text-[#3A3A38]\" data-kid=\"363\"><svg width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#B49452\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" data-kid=\"364\"></svg> São José dos Campos</span>\n          <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-[#E8E5DF] bg-white px-4 py-2.5 text-[12px] tracking-wide text-[#3A3A38]\" data-kid=\"367\"><svg width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#B49452\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" data-kid=\"368\"></svg> Jacareí</span>\n          <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-[#E8E5DF] bg-white px-4 py-2.5 text-[12px] tracking-wide text-[#3A3A38]\" data-kid=\"371\"><svg width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#B49452\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" data-kid=\"372\"></svg> Taubaté</span>\n          <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-[#E8E5DF] bg-white px-4 py-2.5 text-[12px] tracking-wide text-[#3A3A38]\" data-kid=\"375\"><svg width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#B49452\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" data-kid=\"376\"></svg> Caçapava</span>\n          <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-[#E8E5DF] bg-white px-4 py-2.5 text-[12px] tracking-wide text-[#3A3A38]\" data-kid=\"379\"><svg width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#B49452\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" data-kid=\"380\"></svg> Pindamonhangaba</span>\n          <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-[#E8E5DF] bg-white px-4 py-2.5 text-[12px] tracking-wide text-[#3A3A38]\" data-kid=\"383\"><svg width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#B49452\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" data-kid=\"384\"></svg> Vale do Paraíba</span>\n        </div>\n        <p data-reveal class=\"font-display mt-10 text-[20px] font-light italic leading-[1.55] text-[#3A3A38]\" data-kid=\"387\">\n          <span class=\"text-[#B49452]\" data-kid=\"388\">“</span>Identificamos oportunidades com potencial de valorização em todo o Estado de São Paulo.<span class=\"text-[#B49452]\" data-kid=\"389\">”</span>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div data-reveal class=\"relative flex items-center justify-center\" data-kid=\"390\">\n        <div class=\"relative aspect-square w-full max-w-[520px]\" data-kid=\"391\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 500 500\" class=\"h-full w-full\" data-kid=\"392\"></svg>\n          <span class=\"ring-pulse absolute left-[57.5%] top-[48%] h-5 w-5 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full border border-[#B49452]\" data-kid=\"407\"></span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  \n  <section class=\"bg-[#F4F2ED] py-[150px]\" data-kid=\"408\">\n    <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1280px] px-10\" data-kid=\"409\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-end justify-between\" data-kid=\"410\">\n        <div data-kid=\"411\">\n          <div data-reveal class=\"flex items-center gap-4 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#6B6A66]\" data-kid=\"412\">\n            <span class=\"grow-line h-px w-10 bg-[#B49452]\" style=\"transform-origin:left;\" data-kid=\"413\"></span> Depoimentos\n          </div>\n          <h2 data-reveal class=\"font-display mt-7 text-[56px] font-light leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.025em]\" data-kid=\"414\">\n            Resultados que falam por si.\n          </h2>\n        </div>\n        <span data-reveal class=\"font-display text-[44px] font-light leading-none text-[#DDD9D0]\" data-kid=\"415\">06</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div data-reveal-group class=\"mt-16 grid grid-cols-3 gap-7\" data-kid=\"416\">\n        <figure data-reveal class=\"flex h-full flex-col justify-between border border-[#E8E5DF] bg-white p-9\" data-kid=\"417\">\n          <div data-kid=\"418\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"419\">\n              <span class=\"font-display text-[64px] font-light leading-[0.6] text-[#B49452]\" data-kid=\"420\">“</span>\n              <span class=\"flex gap-1 text-[#B49452]\" data-kid=\"421\">\n                <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" data-kid=\"422\"></svg>\n                <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" data-kid=\"424\"></svg>\n                <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" data-kid=\"426\"></svg>\n                <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" data-kid=\"428\"></svg>\n                <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" data-kid=\"430\"></svg>\n              </span>\n            </div>\n            <blockquote class=\"mt-7 text-[16px] leading-[1.75] text-[#0C0B09]\" data-kid=\"432\">\n              Consegui adquirir um imóvel abaixo do valor de mercado com total segurança.\n            </blockquote>\n          </div>\n          <figcaption class=\"mt-9 flex items-center gap-4 border-t border-[#E8E5DF] pt-6\" data-kid=\"433\">\n            <span class=\"grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#3A3A38] text-[13px] font-medium text-white\" data-kid=\"434\">IN</span>\n            <div data-kid=\"435\">\n              <div class=\"text-[14px] font-medium\" data-kid=\"436\">Investidor</div>\n              <div class=\"mt-0.5 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#6B6A66]\" data-kid=\"437\">São José dos Campos</div>\n            </div>\n          </figcaption>\n        </figure>\n        <figure data-reveal class=\"flex h-full flex-col justify-between border border-[#E8E5DF] bg-white p-9\" data-kid=\"438\">\n          <div data-kid=\"439\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"440\">\n              <span class=\"font-display text-[64px] font-light leading-[0.6] text-[#B49452]\" data-kid=\"441\">“</span>\n              <span class=\"flex gap-1 text-[#B49452]\" data-kid=\"442\">\n                <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" data-kid=\"443\"></svg>\n                <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" data-kid=\"445\"></svg>\n                <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" data-kid=\"447\"></svg>\n                <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" data-kid=\"449\"></svg>\n                <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" data-kid=\"451\"></svg>\n              </span>\n            </div>\n            <blockquote class=\"mt-7 text-[16px] leading-[1.75] text-[#0C0B09]\" data-kid=\"453\">\n              Excelente suporte durante todo o processo de compra.\n            </blockquote>\n          </div>\n          <figcaption class=\"mt-9 flex items-center gap-4 border-t border-[#E8E5DF] pt-6\" data-kid=\"454\">\n            <span class=\"grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#3A3A38] text-[13px] font-medium text-white\" data-kid=\"455\">CC</span>\n            <div data-kid=\"456\">\n              <div class=\"text-[14px] font-medium\" data-kid=\"457\">Cliente Caixa</div>\n              <div class=\"mt-0.5 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#6B6A66]\" data-kid=\"458\">Jacareí</div>\n            </div>\n          </figcaption>\n        </figure>\n        <figure data-reveal class=\"flex h-full flex-col justify-between border border-[#E8E5DF] bg-white p-9\" data-kid=\"459\">\n          <div data-kid=\"460\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"461\">\n              <span class=\"font-display text-[64px] font-light leading-[0.6] text-[#B49452]\" data-kid=\"462\">“</span>\n              <span class=\"flex gap-1 text-[#B49452]\" data-kid=\"463\">\n                <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" data-kid=\"464\"></svg>\n                <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" data-kid=\"466\"></svg>\n                <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" data-kid=\"468\"></svg>\n                <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" data-kid=\"470\"></svg>\n                <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" data-kid=\"472\"></svg>\n              </span>\n            </div>\n            <blockquote class=\"mt-7 text-[16px] leading-[1.75] text-[#0C0B09]\" data-kid=\"474\">\n              Atendimento consultivo e oportunidades que realmente fazem sentido.\n            </blockquote>\n          </div>\n          <figcaption class=\"mt-9 flex items-center gap-4 border-t border-[#E8E5DF] pt-6\" data-kid=\"475\">\n            <span class=\"grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#3A3A38] text-[13px] font-medium text-white\" data-kid=\"476\">EM</span>\n            <div data-kid=\"477\">\n              <div class=\"text-[14px] font-medium\" data-kid=\"478\">Empresário</div>\n              <div class=\"mt-0.5 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#6B6A66]\" data-kid=\"479\">Taubaté</div>\n            </div>\n          </figcaption>\n        </figure>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  \n  <section id=\"contato\" class=\"py-[150px]\" data-kid=\"480\">\n    <div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-[1180px] grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr] items-center gap-20 px-10\" data-kid=\"481\">\n      <div data-kid=\"482\">\n        <div data-reveal class=\"flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"483\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#6B6A66]\" data-kid=\"484\">\n            <span class=\"grow-line h-px w-10 bg-[#B49452]\" style=\"transform-origin:left;\" data-kid=\"485\"></span> Cadastre-se\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"font-display text-[44px] font-light leading-none text-[#E8E5DF]\" data-kid=\"486\">07</span>\n        </div>\n        <h2 data-reveal class=\"font-display mt-7 text-[54px] font-light leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.025em]\" data-kid=\"487\">\n          Receba oportunidades imobiliárias <em class=\"italic text-[#8A7340]\" data-kid=\"488\">antes do mercado</em>.\n        </h2>\n        <p data-reveal class=\"mt-7 max-w-[480px] text-[16px] leading-[1.75] text-[#6B6A66]\" data-kid=\"489\">\n          Cadastre-se para receber oportunidades selecionadas diretamente no WhatsApp, com curadoria e análise de potencial.\n        </p>\n        <ul data-reveal class=\"mt-9 space-y-4 text-[14px] text-[#3A3A38]\" data-kid=\"490\">\n          <li class=\"flex items-center gap-4\" data-kid=\"491\"><span class=\"h-px w-7 bg-[#B49452]\" data-kid=\"492\"></span> Sem spam — apenas oportunidades reais</li>\n          <li class=\"flex items-center gap-4\" data-kid=\"493\"><span class=\"h-px w-7 bg-[#B49452]\" data-kid=\"494\"></span> Análise de valorização incluída</li>\n          <li class=\"flex items-center gap-4\" data-kid=\"495\"><span class=\"h-px w-7 bg-[#B49452]\" data-kid=\"496\"></span> Atendimento humano e consultivo</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n\n      <form data-reveal class=\"border border-[#E8E5DF] border-t-2 border-t-[#B49452] bg-white p-11 shadow-[0_48px_90px_-56px_rgba(12,11,9,0.35)]\" onsubmit=\"return false;\" data-kid=\"497\">\n        <label class=\"block\" data-kid=\"498\">\n          <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#6B6A66]\" data-kid=\"499\">\n            <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-kid=\"500\"></svg>\n            Nome\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"input-line mt-1 block\" data-kid=\"503\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"w-full bg-transparent py-3.5 text-[14px] outline-hidden\" data-kid=\"504\"></span>\n        </label>\n        <label class=\"mt-7 block\" data-kid=\"505\">\n          <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#6B6A66]\" data-kid=\"506\">\n            <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-kid=\"507\"></svg>\n            Telefone\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"input-line mt-1 block\" data-kid=\"509\"><input type=\"tel\" placeholder=\"(12) 99999-9999\" class=\"w-full bg-transparent py-3.5 text-[14px] outline-hidden placeholder:text-[#6B6A66]/45\" data-kid=\"510\"></span>\n        </label>\n        <label class=\"mt-7 block\" data-kid=\"511\">\n          <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#6B6A66]\" data-kid=\"512\">\n            <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-kid=\"513\"></svg>\n            E-mail\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"input-line mt-1 block\" data-kid=\"516\"><input type=\"email\" class=\"w-full bg-transparent py-3.5 text-[14px] outline-hidden\" data-kid=\"517\"></span>\n        </label>\n        <button type=\"submit\" class=\"group mt-10 inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-3 bg-[#0C0B09] px-8 py-[18px] text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_24px_48px_-20px_rgba(12,11,9,0.5)]\" style=\"transition: transform .4s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1), box-shadow .4s;\" data-kid=\"518\">\n          Quero receber oportunidades\n          <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" class=\"group-hover:translate-x-1\" style=\"transition: transform .4s;\" data-kid=\"519\"></svg>\n        </button>\n        <p class=\"mt-5 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-center text-[11px] text-[#6B6A66]\" data-kid=\"522\">\n          <svg width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#B49452\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" data-kid=\"523\"></svg>\n          Seus dados são tratados com confidencialidade.\n        </p>\n      </form>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  \n  <footer class=\"bg-[#0C0B09] text-white\" data-kid=\"526\">\n    \n    <div class=\"border-b border-white/10\" data-kid=\"527\">\n      <div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-[1280px] items-center justify-between px-10 py-14\" data-kid=\"528\">\n        <h3 class=\"font-display text-[36px] font-light tracking-[-0.02em]\" data-kid=\"529\">Pronto para investir com <em class=\"italic text-[#D9C9A3]\" data-kid=\"530\">critério</em>?</h3>\n        <a href=\"https://wa.me/5512991968709\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"group inline-flex items-center gap-3 border border-[#B49452] px-8 py-4 text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#D9C9A3] hover:bg-[#B49452] hover:text-[#0C0B09]\" style=\"transition: background-color .4s, color .4s;\" data-kid=\"531\">\n          Falar com Especialista\n          <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" class=\"group-hover:translate-x-0.5\" style=\"transition: transform .4s;\" data-kid=\"532\"></svg>\n        </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-[1280px] grid-cols-[1.4fr_1fr_1fr] gap-12 px-10 py-16\" data-kid=\"535\">\n      <div data-kid=\"536\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-2.5\" data-kid=\"537\">\n          <span class=\"font-display text-[30px] font-light\" data-kid=\"538\">Ícaro</span>\n          <span class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.32em] text-[#D9C9A3]\" data-kid=\"539\">Imóveis</span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"mt-6 max-w-[360px] text-[14px] leading-[1.8] text-white/55\" data-kid=\"540\">\n          Especialista em investimentos imobiliários, imóveis Caixa e oportunidades imobiliárias no Vale do Paraíba.\n        </p>\n      <